    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωστρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽχώννυμἰ χελώνη χ.</span> a shed to protect
		besiegers  in <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>filling up the ditch of a town,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.41.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.68
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				42.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				18.8
			</span></i>, al.; without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελώνη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				97.28
			</span></i>, Did.ad <i><span class="en">
				D.
				11.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωστρίδες</span> distd. fr.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελῶναι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				24.1
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελῶναι κριοφόροι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				20.91
			</span></i>.</div>
